Regional Outlook
North America is the largest market, accounting for an estimated 38% of global revenue in 2025.
The region benefits from stringent workplace-safety requirements and a high concentration of food-processing and manufacturing facilities.
Europe remains an important market due to advanced industrial automation and strong hygiene standards.
Asia-Pacific offers significant growth opportunities as manufacturing, pharmaceuticals, food processing and semiconductor production expand.
China, Japan, South Korea and India are important regional markets for industrial and cleanroom material handling.
